page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus +3</a>:</b> +3 Equipment bonus to the DC of Necromancy spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Illusion Focus +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Illusion Focus +3</a>:</b> +3 Equipment bonus to the DC of Illusion spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Hit_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Point\">Profane Lifeforce +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Hit_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Point\">Profane Lifeforce +15</a>:</b> +15 <a href=\"/page/Profane_bonus\" title=\"Profane bonus\">Profane bonus</a> to Hit Points.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-pars